abstract: "Finite graph-to-topology simulator associated with Uphill graph topologies and degree-constrained realizations of posets. Version 1.12.1 is the current published simulator. Earlier independently reviewed version 1.11.2 is preserved separately; its review does not transfer to this version. Finite computations illustrate examples and do not prove manuscript theorems."
